1
00:04:44,210 --> 00:04:50,210
100 years later, lightning strikes twice.

2
00:09:28,421 --> 00:09:34,421
Titanic II is a action, thriller, romance film directed by Shane van Dyke.

3
00:14:12,631 --> 00:14:18,631
On the 100th anniversary of the original voyage, a modern luxury liner
christened "Titanic 2," follows the path of its namesake.

4
00:18:56,842 --> 00:19:02,842
But when a tsunami hurls an ice berg into the new ship's path, the
passengers and crew must fight to avoid a similar fate.

5
00:23:41,052 --> 00:23:47,052
Hayden Walsh, played by Shane van Dyke.

6
00:28:25,263 --> 00:28:31,263
Amy Maine, played by Marie Westbrook.

7
00:33:09,473 --> 00:33:15,473
James Maine, played by Bruce Davison.

8
00:37:53,684 --> 00:37:59,684
Dr. Kim Patterson, played by Brooke Burns.

9
00:42:37,894 --> 00:42:43,894
Kelly Wade, played by Michelle Glavan.

10
00:47:22,105 --> 00:47:28,105
Elmer Coolidge, played by Carey van Dyke.

11
00:52:06,315 --> 00:52:12,315
Titanic II is a 2010 American drama disaster film written, directed by
and starring Shane Van Dyke and distributed by the Asylum.

12
00:56:50,526 --> 00:56:56,526
It is not a sequel to the 1997 film.

13
01:01:34,736 --> 01:01:40,736
The film is set on a fictional replica Titanic that sets off exactly 100 years after the original ship's maiden voyage to perform the reverse route, but
global warming and the forces of nature cause history to repeat itself on the same night, only on a more disastrous and deadly scale.

14
01:06:18,947 --> 01:06:24,947
Titanic II was released direct-to-TV in Australia on August 7, 2010.

15
01:11:03,157 --> 01:11:09,157
It was released on August 25 in the United States to critically negative response, though the
film's ensemble cast performances, particularly that of Bruce Davison, received praise.

16
01:15:47,368 --> 01:15:53,368
A supernatural horror-themed sequel, Titanic 666, was
released twelve years later, in 2022.

17
01:20:31,578 --> 01:20:37,578
The film explores themes of iceberg, titanic, bad
weather, cruise liner, commemoration.

18
01:25:15,789 --> 01:25:21,789
The tone is emotional and intense.
